abstract: >-
  Code, pre-registration documents and result tables for a study of voxel-scale
  damage operators applied to segmented Ni-YSZ solid oxide cell electrode
  tomograms. The tomography data itself is third-party and is not redistributed
  here; see the Zenodo record cited in the README.
